{%- comment -%}
  The Team Butti bike illustrated with Higgsfield, cut into layers by tools/art/moto-higgsfield (README there).
  Layers, bottom to top: wheels (spin), body with the rider (suspension), swingarm (pivots on the rear axle), fork lower (stays on the front axle).
  data-*: wheelbase, centre between the axles, wheel radius and swingarm length as a share of the width, ground line as a share of the height.
  The numbers come from tools/art/moto-higgsfield/export.py: rerun it if the drawing changes.
{%- endcomment -%}
